{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39819","headline":"行朝早春侍师门宴西溪席上作 · 殷文圭","name":"行朝早春侍师门宴西溪席上作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西溪水色净於苔，画鷁横风绦帐开。\n弦管旋飘蓬岛去，公卿皆是蘂宫来。\n金鳞掷浪钱翻荇，玉爵黏香雪泛梅。\n三榜生徒逾七十，岂期龙坂纳非才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷文圭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39819.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39819","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}